      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK KERMARO (8) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.37 beating STRAIGHT OUT. Won at his only start from this box. Great chance to get the job done again. ZIPPING SAIGO (1) has a strong record this trip with five wins and four placings from 12 starts. In the money last time at this track (17.62) in a Grade 4, finishing a one length second. Can feature in the finish. MAGICAL SAIDE (7) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from four tries. Scored by one length last time (17.54) in a Grade 4 over 324m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. HELLO CHEVY (4) missed the frame latest (30.63) when fifth over 515m at The Gardens in a Grade 5. Has already won out of this draw.",
